    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Radford are delighted to bring to the market this wonderful architecturally-designed detached 5 bedroom family home which is set on an elevated site within a quiet cul de sac overlooking the sea in Fethard.\n\nThe house has been designed with modern living in mind with high ceilings, feature brick walls, large reception rooms, modern sanitary ware including a Jack and Jill shower room, walk in wardrobes, large utility room and elevated sun room to name but a few. The property has fibre broadband and the added convenience of a Electric Vehicle (EV) Charging Port. \n\nThe accommodation is presented over two floors and comprises entrance porch, entrance hall, living room kitchen / dining room, sun room, utility room, guest wc, 5 bedrooms, bathroom, wc, two ensuite. There is also a large detached garage to the rear.\nThe gardens are landscaped with stunning sea views and provide ample off street parking, enclosed cobblelock patio area with built gas fireplace.\n\nThe location needs to be seen to be believed right in the heart of the Sunny South East with some of the most spectacular views, beaches and facilities that Ireland has to offer. This wonderful property is close to Fethard, Duncannon, Ramsgrange and beyond ensuring an array of schools, supermarkets and shops on your doorstep not to mention the Passage East Car Ferry. Wexford, New Ross and Waterford are all very accessible as is Rosslare Harbour."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.96m x 1.17m\nwooden flooring, vaulted ceiling, double doors to\n\nEntrance Hall - 12.89m x 3.87m (max)\nFeature brick wall, wooden flooring, recessed lighting\n\nGuest WC - 2m x 1.48m\nFeature brick wall, tiled flooring wc, pedestal wash hand basin\n\nLiving Room - 6.37m x 4.57m\nStunning living room with feature brick chimney with wood burning stove, granite hearth, wooden mantle, wooden flooring, dual aspect\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 6.34m x 4.26m\nFitted wall and floor units, built in sink, built in oven, 6 ring gas hob, extractor fan, plumbed for dishwasher, feature brick wall, tiled floor, tiled splashback, dual aspect, island with breakfast bar and storage, recessed lighting, wine display, wood pellet stove, arch and steps leading to family room\n\nFamily Room - 4.61m x 3.25m\nTriple aspect room with wooden flooring, vaulted ceiling, recessed lighting, stunning sea views, double doors to rear\n\nUtility Room - 5.14m x 2.96m (max)\nFitted floor units, extensive storage units, stainless steel sink unit, shelving, tiled floor, plumbed for washing machine, window to rear, door to rear\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.57m x 4.06m\nPicture window to side, wooden flooring, recessed lighting\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.95m x 3.66m\nPicture window to rear, wooden flooring\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - 1.78m x 1.48m\nFitted wardrobe with shelving and drawers, wooden flooring, door to \"Jack and Jill\" shower room\n\nShower Room - 3.93m x 1.55m\nFully tiled hower room wtih wc, pedestal wah hand basin thermostate power shower, vhrome towel rail, recessed lighting\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.95m x 3.68m\nPicture window to the rear, wooden flooring\n\nWalk in wardrobe - 2.01m x 1.77m\nFitted wardrobe with shelving and drawers, wooden flooring, door to \"Jack & Jill\" shower room\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nLanding - 5.23m x 2.86m (max)\nVelux window, wooden flooring\n\nBathroom - 3.23m x 3.17m (max)\nFully tiled walls and floor, corner bath with shower attachment, wc, pedestal wash hand basin, step in shower with thermostat power shower\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.46m x 4.07m\nPicture window to rear and side, wooden flooring, fitted wardrobes, vanity area\n\nMaster Bedroom - 9.59m x 4.49m\nTriple aspect room with wooden flooring, recessed lighting, double doors with stunning views to outside\n\nWalk in dressing room - 4.34m x 4.02m\nWooden flooring, velux window, recessed lighting, door to attic space\n\nInner hall - 2.42m x 2.26m (max)\nWooden flooring\n\nEnsuite - 3.33m x 3.22m\nSuite comprising \"His and Hers\" sinks, wc, step in fully tiled double shower with thermostat power shower chrome towel rail, 2 x velux, tiled floor, part tiled walls\n\nGarage - 7.1m x 5.35m\nWith double doors and pedestrian access to side, wired for electrics\n\n"
      },
